<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Exploratory Memory-Augmented LLM Agent via Hybrid On- and Off-Policy Optimization</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zeyuan Liu
